     "id": "ja-a0-nombres-en-g1",
     "title": "Counting in Japanese",
     "md": "From **いち** (1) to **じゅう** (10), each number is one word. 4 is **よん** (or し), 7 is **なな** (or しち).",
     "examples": [
      {
       "text": "いち、に、さん",
       "tr": "one, two, three"
      }
     ]
    },
